Chapter: CrossPlaneItems
  cites CodexMagic chapter PlanarExchange
  cites CodexMagic chapter RPGEngine
  cites CodexMagic chapter GameRegistry
  cites CodexMagic chapter CampaignWorld
  cites CodexMagic chapter Token
  cites CodexMagic chapter ClanEconomy

 Cross-plane item utility and dungeon interaction. Items exist
 across game boundaries - a CodexMagic card becomes a spell in
 the RPG, a vehicle part in a racer, a key in someone's dungeon.
 Players spend coin to explore other people's games, spawn content
 in foreign dungeons, and transfer relevant bits back to their
 own world.

 The planar membrane is permeable. Everything connects.

 We say:

Section: Item Manifestation - One item, many forms

  ItemManifest = record {
    planar-id : Integer,
    manifestations : List Manifestation
  }

  Manifestation = record {
    game-id : Integer,
    form : ManifestForm,
    stats : ManifestStats,
    usable : Boolean,
    conditions : List UseCondition
  }

  ManifestForm =
    | FormCard (Integer)
    | FormSpell (SpellManifest)
    | FormWeapon (WeaponManifest)
    | FormArmor (ArmorManifest)
    | FormKey (KeyManifest)
    | FormVehiclePart (PartManifest)
    | FormConsumable (ConsumableManifest)
    | FormCompanion (CompanionManifest)
    | FormTerrain (TerrainManifest)
    | FormCustom (Text)

  ManifestStats = record {
    power-level : Integer,
    durability : Integer,
    charges : Integer,
    max-charges : Integer,
    cooldown : Integer
  }

  UseCondition =
    | CondMinLevel (Integer)
    | CondClassReq (Integer)
    | CondQuestComplete (Integer)
    | CondOwnerOnly
    | CondSingleUse
    | CondCostPerUse (Integer)

Section: Spell Manifest - Card becomes spell

  SpellManifest = record {
    spell-name : Text,
    school : SpellSchool,
    mp-cost : Integer,
    damage : Integer,
    heal : Integer,
    spell-fx : SpellEffect,
    range : Integer,
    area : Integer,
    duration : Integer
  }

  SpellSchool =
    | Evocation
    | Conjuration
    | Abjuration
    | Transmutation
    | Necromancy
    | Divination
    | SpellEnchantment
    | Illusion

  SpellEffect =
    | SpellDamage
    | SpellHeal
    | SpellBuff (Text)
    | SpellDebuff (Text)
    | SpellSummon (Integer)
    | SpellTeleport
    | SpellReveal
    | SpellControl

